WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:05.240
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.540
This is the story of their lives and adventures.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.840
I’m gonna have an endless
Wild Area Pokémon catching spree!

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.630
Well, that was the plan...

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:39.060
You’re too eager to leap in,
Sarunori.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:40.810
Oh, well.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:43.360
Let’s have dinner, go to bed early,
and try again tomorr—

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:44.820
Dinner!

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:45.940
Why didn’t I think of that?

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.150
We can use tasty-smelling food
to lure Pokémon out!

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.450
Ooh! Good idea!

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:55.450
All done!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.700
Let’s dig in!

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.420
Curry really is the best!

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.090
Oh, no!

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:08.420
We ate it all!

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:14.510
Go!

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.390
Shush!

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.390
Bacchinkey! Beat Pokémon!
Grass type!

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:25.690
The faster a Bacchinkey can
beat out a rhythm with its two sticks,

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.280
the more respect
it wins from its peers!

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:30.150
I’ve never seen one before!

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.450
That’s your evolved form, Sarunori!

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:37.540
Its <i>two</i> sticks...?

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:42.120
It’s getting away!

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:44.420
Monster Ball, go!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.800
What?!

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:48.760
Go!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.780
Bacchinkey really batted
the ball with that baton!

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:39.240
They’re not batons, they’re sticks.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.080
But it only had one stick,
unlike what the Index said...

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:46.500
Did that Bacchinkey get you kids?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.870
Huh? Oh. Yes.

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:51.290
Oh, I’m a Wild Area
ingredients vendor.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:54.550
If you have any concerns
about food, I’m your man!

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.470
An ingredients vendor...

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:59.640
Oh, do you have
curry ingredients, then?

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.810
Aye! One set of
curry ingredients coming up!

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:09.940
That guy’s been spotted
around here a lot lately.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:13.440
He steals food from campers
every now and then.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.240
And that’s where I come in.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.410
Well, you kids
better take care too!

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.620
We will!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.580
And so...

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.910
Operation:
“Catching With Curry: Vengeance!”

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.120
Is he really gonna come?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.420
Definitely!

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:35.550
A tasty curry like that
is completely irresistible!

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:38.170
Look, there he is!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.720
You’re right.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.190
Okay, now’s my chance!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.860
Monster Ball—

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.200
Go?

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.200
Stop, Sarunori!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.130
Gah...

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.880
What is it doing?!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:41.400
What’s that...?

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.530
Grooming!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:47.910
Something that Bacchinkey do
to cheer up their friends!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.910
It’s said to be
a mark of friendship and trust!

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.040
That <i>does</i> look nice.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.290
Yeah...

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.150
Oh, Sarunori!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.450
Go, let’s follow!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.740
R-Right!

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.870
Where’d they go?!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:34.790
Over there!

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.500
I wonder what they’re doing.

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:23.800
Kinda looks like a lesson.

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:28.050
I’ve never seen Sarunori
listen so intently before.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:31.180
They get along so well together!

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:34.810
He might be a good role model
for Sarunori to learn from!

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.560
Hey, Bacchinkey!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:39.230
Why don’t you come with us?

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:43.070
Instead of being alone out here,
you can be with Sarunori, me, and all our friends—

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.490
What was that?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:08.800
Loads of Bacchinkey?!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.930
They look angry.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:14.640
Is this their territory?

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.240
What’s going on?

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:44.670
Who’s that Pokémon?

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.970
Gorillander! Drummer Pokémon!
Grass type!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:52.140
The one with the best drumming techniques
becomes the boss of the troop!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:56.100
It has a gentle disposition
and values harmony among its group!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:35.390
So this is the beat
of wild Bacchinkey...

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.350
I think I’m starting to like this!

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:39.560
You’re not the only one.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.020
Look at Pikachu and Sarunori!

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:21.140
Huh? What happened?

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.940
I get it!

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:26.690
He can’t keep up with everyone else
with only one stick!

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.840
The poor guy...

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.390
Pocket Monsters!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.780
I think this was
the way he went...

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:31.250
He must have it hard,
not being able to drum like his friends.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.550
Can’t we do something for him?

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:36.010
If we could find
a stick that fits...

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:41.100
Even if it fits,
they want a certain feel...

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.140
They can be picky
with their sticks.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.430
Of course...

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.390
Sarunori?

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.490
It’s giving up its own stick...?!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.740
It’d go that far for him?!

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:11.420
Sarunori!

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:19.180
Bacchinkey...

00:12:58.550 --> 00:12:59.930
Huh?!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.590
Of course!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.600
He can just
drum twice as fast instead!

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:09.350
Look how well Sarunori’s doing it!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:11.850
You’d be able to do it even better!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.480
Come and train with us!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.250
All right!
Let’s get training, Bacchinkey!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:40.880
Catch Pikachu
with a <i>whoosh</i> and a <i>vwoosh!</i>

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.680
Negigaknight! Use Brutal Swing!

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:50.520
Keep at it, Bacchinkey!

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.940
Put your whole body into it!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.560
Negigaknight!
One more time!

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.030
Why don’t we leave this to Satoshi,

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.450
and look for some food
while we have the chance?

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.160
What is it?

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.000
Isn’t that...?

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.300
Ooh! Nana Berries!

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:44.320
That’s my Sarunori.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:46.660
You’ve already made a new friend!

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.390
They would usually
live in troops, after all...

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.930
Of course they form
strong bonds.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.520
Huh?
You’re giving them to us?

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.600
Thank you.
That’s a great help!

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.490
You’re worried about him...

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:29.280
I’m sure he’ll be fine.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.120
So just wait a little longer, okay?

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.710
Huh, really...?

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:41.800
So that’s it...

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.800
I wonder if she’s still
watching us in secret.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.010
That’s the spirit!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.490
What’s he doing?

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.620
Sword fighting?

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:12.490
But...

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.370
That’s great!
It looks like so much fun!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.620
Let us join in, too!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.120
Yeah!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:20.130
Pikachu!
Use Iron Tail!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.590
Go! Negigaknight!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.680
Yokubarisu!
Use Seed Machine Gun!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.830
Great job, Bacchinkey!

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:49.010
What’s going on?

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.440
Go, is he...?

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:13.110
That Bacchinkey...
He really did it!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.630
They’re calling for Bacchinkey!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.380
Let’s go, Bacchinkey!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.500
Now, they’re about to start!

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:06.750
Give it all you’ve got!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:43.620
All right!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.000
He’s in perfect sync!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.600
Wow!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:19.570
That’s the power Sarunori has...
The power to breathe life into the forest!

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:20.530
Yeah.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.620
You were trying to catch Bacchinkey,

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.830
but I guess you don’t
feel like that anymore, huh?

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:34.130
Ooh, Sarunori looks happy too!

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.840
Yeah...

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.970
That sounded great, Bacchinkey!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.330
Go on, I won’t mind.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.120
I mean...

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:10.540
If you want to stay here, then—

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.630
Wh-What’re you doing?!

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:15.670
Isn’t that grooming?

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:16.800
Grooming...

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:18.260
Grooming!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:20.680
A mark of friendship and trust!

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:23.300
Of course...

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:28.020
I’ll keep trying to be
a great partner for you!

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:30.690
So let’s keep getting along!

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:37.730
Satoshi and Go managed to reunite
the Bacchinkey who lost his stick with his friends.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:40.650
Having deepened their bond
with Sarunori,

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.490
their adventure yet continues.

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:09.660
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:10.950
Go!

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:13.540
Heard you got
your next Trial Mission!

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:15.330
It’s a Raid Battle...

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:16.670
My mission this time...

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:17.290
Against who?

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.790
The Legendary Pokémon, Freezer...

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:22.960
Whoa! That’s so exciting!

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:24.170
Tokio?!

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:24.800
Go?!

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:25.680
My, oh, my.

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:28.010
I never expected
to see you two here.

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:28.930
Shigeru?!

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:31.060
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:34.390
Trial Mission! A Freezing Raid Battle!!
